  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTEGRATED FINANCIAL MANAGEMENT III - TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project restructuring and additional financing is expected to deepen and consolidate reforms initiated under the SIAF project geared to increase public sector efficiency and transparency at the central and municipal levels in the areas of public finance planning, management, and control by strengthening the processes and systems and supporting the institutionalization of these processes and systems through the transfer of ownership to the relevant institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
